sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as RDCRUISP (adapter)
    participant B as CONEW-N
    participant CR as NCCRUISE
    participant CO as NCCONTRACT
    participant CU as NCCUSTOMER
    UI->>B: ID-CUSTOMER-IN, ID-CRUISE-IN
    B->>CR: FIND CRUISE-ID, GET *ISN in hold
    B->>CR: CRUISE-STATUS := VAL(status) - 1, UPDATE
    B->>CO: READ (1) DESCENDING BY CONTRACT-ID, fake UPDATE (hold)
    B->>CU: FIND PERSON-ID = ID-CUSTOMER-IN (9918 if none)
    B->>CO: STORE {CONTRACT-ID+1, PRICE-1W, *DATN, ID-CRUISE, ID-CUSTOMER}
    B->>B: END TRANSACTION (or BACKOUT on 9902/9918)
